### Home API
GET http://localhost:8080/

###

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

###

### Create User - John
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Johnty Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

###

